Package: lbxd
Version: 3.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Pranav Karra <pranav@karra.dev>
Homepage: https://github.com/Pranav-Karra-3301/lbxd
Description: Beautiful command-line tool for Letterboxd
 lbxd v3.0.0 is a beautiful command-line tool written in pure Rust
 that brings Letterboxd to your terminal. View movie activity, browse
 collections interactively, search for movies, and export data.
 .
 This version is a complete rewrite in pure Rust with no Python
 dependencies required.
 .
 Features:
  - Interactive TUI for browsing complete movie collections
  - View recent activity, ratings, and reviews for any user
  - Search functionality for titles in user activity
  - Movie database integration with TMDB
  - Export data to JSON or Markdown formats
  - Beautiful terminal display with poster images
  - Intelligent caching for offline access
Recommends: viu
